@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam defaultFontColor #172033
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam titleFontSize 20
skinparam ArrowFontSize 14
skinparam noteFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
title Session and transport settings
actor Browser
component "Nginx HTTPS ingress" as Nginx
component "Laravel session and CSRF policies" as API
database "Database sessions" as Sessions
Browser --> Nginx : HTTPS / secure cookie
Nginx --> API : local FastCGI socket
API --> Sessions : encrypted session data
API --> Browser : HTTP-only cookie; SameSite=lax
note bottom of API : Mutating browser requests require CSRF protection
note bottom of Browser : PAT credentials used by Git clients are separate from browser sessions
@enduml
